  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Initially, you are given 3 balls, which randomly bounce off the walls
    and shoot upward, towards the spawn of enemies. You can buy more balls with your
    gold, so you can be more sure that no one will pass through the line.\r\n\r\nThere
    are different types of enemies that will spawn at different stages of the game,
    to kill some you need to hit them with a bullet more than once. You need to protect
    your line in the middle from enemies, if at least 1 enemy crosses it, you will
    be forced to start from the beginning.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t worry about losing,
    save money from session to session and buy balls to better defend yourself, overcome
    your records!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8febbd662b6cbdc4f960322cb7497e60, type: 2}
